<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Launcher-action icon, built as Supernova's own icons are: the icon paper
     behind a glyph split like the logo's spark, the whole glyph painted blue
     and its top half laid over it in red. An adaptive icon, so it takes the
     icon shape, glass and shadow as any other does. -->
